{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cameras are rolling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are live</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viewers are watching</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investors are bidding</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/7d84ce4a413cbc6b4c6198e92f9ccef1.poster.avif?t=1773667887\" width=504 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/7d84ce4a413cbc6b4c6198e92f9ccef1.webm?t=1773667887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>In this dystopian world life holds no value. your 9 to 5 wage slave job was no longer enough to pay for your single room flat so you did the next best thing and signed your life away to <strong>LUCKROT CORP. </strong> <br>  <br>You're a <strong>live streamer</strong> now... dream come true.   <br>You are thrown into the gauntlet filled with mutant freaks and traps, you must clear every room, each one bringing you closer to death.   <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/3abfa5074a7b41126e077a580ff75ef5.poster.avif?t=1773667887\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/3abfa5074a7b41126e077a580ff75ef5.webm?t=1773667887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/3abfa5074a7b41126e077a580ff75ef5.mp4?t=1773667887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your enemies? once human scum, enemies of the government, now mutated freaks released onto the arena as fodder destined to die. <strong>The viewers absolutely love it</strong>.     <br>     <br>The further you get, the more viewers arrive to witness your inevitable demise. They are here for the main event. The boss fights will be a spectacle.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Once you clear a room you can enter the <strong>HUB</strong>, this is where you pay your tax and gamble away the rest of your hard earned cash. Hoping to get a new weapon or ability upgrade. Its the only thing that will help you make it to the end.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/e306bb231c26ebcf02ece35b81dc2617.poster.avif?t=1773667887\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/e306bb231c26ebcf02ece35b81dc2617.webm?t=1773667887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/extras/e306bb231c26ebcf02ece35b81dc2617.mp4?t=1773667887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are only two places in your world:  <br>The <strong>HUB</strong>, and The <strong>Arena</strong>.    <br>There is no going back, you have already signed the <strong>contract.</strong> <br>  <br><strong>Die,</strong> and your place will be taken immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life is a <strong>performance</strong> <br>Your death is <strong>content</strong> <br>   <br>Welcome to <strong>LUCKROT</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823650?t=1773667887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/a9490dac115d318ffdaee57d147e31de82545958/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773667887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823650/edc68ff720896c19a7eb15ee361d131725e94164/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17736